00:03:54,545 --> 00:04:00,545
We Go In at Dawn is a history, war, thriller film directed by Ben Mole.

2
00:07:49,090 --> 00:07:55,090
When a high-ranking war planner is captured and held in a German prisoner of war camp, a
team of specialists take on the dangerous mission of trying to break him out.

3
00:11:43,636 --> 00:11:49,636
Trouble is, he doesn't want to be rescued.

4
00:15:38,181 --> 00:15:44,181
John Seabourne, played by Kelvin Fletcher.

5
00:19:32,727 --> 00:19:38,727
Victor Laurence, played by Christos Lawton.

6
00:23:27,272 --> 00:23:33,272
Ellie, played by Audrey L'Ebrellec.

7
